# ~/.config/cua-driver/qualified-apps
# Apps agents may type into and click on this Omarchy desktop (through cua's
# Hyprland plugin). One per line: <package> <version or *> <executable>.
# Anything not listed is refused (client_not_qualified). Inkscape and
# LibreOffice are built in. Apps with an accessibility tree (GTK, Qt) can
# also be driven by their named buttons and fields without being listed.
foot * /usr/bin/foot
